.TH COMPILE-ZONE 8 "2026-07-23" "rgbdns 0.1.0" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
compile-zone \- compile the packaged authoritative zone
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B /usr/lib/rgbdns/compile-zone
.SH DESCRIPTION
Internal package helper that compiles the managed tinydns source to a
temporary database and atomically installs it as data.cdb.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B RGBDNS_STATE_DIR
Override the managed zone directory (default: /var/lib/rgbdns/tinydns).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tinydns-data (1),
.BR rgbdns-setup (8)
